This repository contains behavioral detection content for identifying activity associated with APT35 (Charming Kitten), an Iranian state-aligned threat actor.

Focus Areas

- Credential phishing campaigns
- Email account compromise (Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo)
- Cloud service abuse (O365, VPN portals)
- Identity-based intrusion techniques
- Social engineering operations

Detection Philosophy

This project focuses on:
- Identity compromise over endpoint malware
- Authentication anomalies over network signatures
- Cloud telemetry over endpoint-only detection

Intended Use

SOC analysts, threat hunters, and detection engineers focused on identity security and cloud intrusion detection.
